roposing.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/d/d9/Prince_tamahiko_proposing.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20140810144305","caption":"Prince Tamahiko предложение Princess Tamako","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/d/d9/Prince_tamahiko_proposing.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20140810144305"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Bandicam_2019-05-30_23-05-13-970.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/f/fb/Bandicam_2019-05-30_23-05-13-970.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20190612032421","caption":"Prince Tamahiko как теннисист","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/f/fb/Bandicam_2019-05-30_23-05-13-970.png/revision/latest?cb=20190612032421"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:PRINCE.PNG","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/c/c2/PRINCE.PNG/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20130804085453","caption":"дом Prince Tamahiko","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/c/c2/PRINCE.PNG/revision/latest?cb=20130804085453"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Tamahikohimespetchi.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/6/60/Tamahikohimespetchi.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20120525185447","caption":"Prince Tamahiko и Himespetchi","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/6/60/Tamahikohimespetchi.png/revision/latest?cb=20120525185447"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Himespetchi_and_prince_tamahiko.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/d/dc/Himespetchi_and_prince_tamahiko.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20220626104308","caption":"На изображении · Химэспэтчи","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/d/dc/Himespetchi_and_prince_tamahiko.png/revision/latest?cb=20220626104308"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:3877035a.webp","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/4/49/3877035a.webp/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20220809035257","caption":"Из альбома «Prince Tamahiko» · № 21","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/4/49/3877035a.webp/revision/latest?cb=20220809035257"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:ChoritchiPuchiPuchiOmisetchi_PianoStudio.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/9/9d/ChoritchiPuchiPuchiOmisetchi_PianoStudio.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20250410072154","caption":"Prince Tamahiko управляет фортепианной студией в Чо~ритчи! Tamagotchi нет Пучи Пучи Omisetchi","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/9/9d/ChoritchiPuchiPuchiOmisetchi_PianoStudio.png/revision/latest?cb=20250410072154"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TP_Prince_Tamahiko_Happy.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/8/84/TP_Prince_Tamahiko_Happy.png/revision/latest?cb=20250329201631","caption":"Happy рендеринг из Tamagotchi Plaza"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:KingTamahiko_m!x_sprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/c/ce/KingTamahiko_m%21x_sprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20250324164946","caption":"Отец Prince Tamahiko (m!x)","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:QueenTamahiko_m!x_sprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/a/a5/QueenTamahiko_m%21x_sprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20250324164946","caption":"мать Prince Tamahiko (m!x)","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Happy_Prince.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/8/87/Happy_Prince.png/revision/latest?cb=20241202163514","caption":"Предмет мебели \"Happy Принц\" (Уни"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Prince_tamahiko_sprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/b/b4/Prince_tamahiko_sprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20130924115733","caption":"Игровой спрайт · Prince Tamahiko","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Prince_Tamahiko15th.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/f/fe/Prince_Tamahiko15th.png/revision/latest?cb=20160528143341","caption":"Из альбома «Prince Tamahiko» · № 28"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Prince_Tamahikom!x.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/3/3e/Prince_Tamahikom%21x.png/revision/latest?cb=20161129211505","caption":"Из альбома «Prince Tamahiko» · № 29"}],"related":[{"id":"tamagotchi-connection-version-5-celebrity-071dde","title":"Tamagotchi Connection Version 5 Celebrity","ru":"Tamagotchi Connection Version 5 Celebrity","kind":"device","note":""},{"id":"tamagotchi-uni-52d523","title":"Tamagotchi Uni","ru":"Tamagotchi Uni","kind":"device","note":"гость (NPC)"},{"id":"tamagotchi-id-l-06561f","title":"Tamagotchi iD L","ru":"Tamagotchi iD L","kind":"device","note":""},{"id":"tamagotchi-m-x-e0c3cb","title":"Tamagotchi m!x","ru":"Tamagotchi m!x","kind":"device","note":"гость (NPC)"}]}